hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"180","We are Abdullah bin Saeed Al-Ashjaj, we are Abdullah bin Numayr, Al-Amash told us. H. Yusuf bin Musa told us, Abu Muawiyah told us, Al-Amash told us. H. Salam bin Junada told us, from Abu Muawiyah, on the authority of Al-A’mash, on the authority of Al-Hakam, on the authority of Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Laila, on the authority of Ka’b bin Ajra, on the authority of Bilal, said: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “wiping over the socks and the veil.” In the hadith of Abu Muawiyah, the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “wiped over the socks and the veil.”"
"181","Al-Qasim bin Muhammad bin Abbad bin Abbad Al-Muhallabi narrated to us, Abdullah bin Dawud narrated to us, he said: I heard Al-Awza’i, on the authority of Yahya bin Abi Kathir. On the authority of Abu Salamah bin Abdul Rahman, on the authority of Jafar bin Amr bin Umayyah Al-Dhamri, on the authority of his father, he said: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace. “He performed ablution and wiped over his socks and his turban.”"
